{"id":"torrey:alliance-and-society-with-the-enemies-of-god","source":"torrey","name":"Alliance And Society With The Enemies Of God","slug":"alliance-and-society-with-the-enemies-of-god","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Forbidden — Ex 23:32; 34:12; De 7:2,3; 13:6,8; Jos 23:6,7; Jdj 2:2; Ezr 9:12; Pr 1:10,15; 2Co 6:14-17; Eph 5:11.","refs":[["Exod",23,32,23,32],["Exod",34,12,34,12],["Deut",7,2,7,2],["Deut",7,3,7,3],["Deut",13,6,13,6],["Deut",13,8,13,8],["Josh",23,6,23,6],["Josh",23,7,23,7],["Judg",2,2,2,2],["Ezra",9,12,9,12],["Prov",1,10,1,10],["Prov",1,15,1,15],["2Cor",6,14,6,17],["Eph",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"Lead to idolatry — Ex 34:15,16; Nu 25:1-8; De 7:4; Jdj 3:5-7; Re 2:20.","refs":[["Exod",34,15,34,15],["Exod",34,16,34,16],["Num",25,1,25,8],["Deut",7,4,7,4],["Judg",3,5,3,7],["Rev",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Have led to murder and human sacrifice — Ps 106:37,38.","refs":[["Ps",106,37,106,37],["Ps",106,38,106,38]]},{"text":"Provoke the anger of God — De 7:4; 31:16,17; 2Ch 19:2; Ezr 9:13,14; Ps 106:29,40; Isa 2:6.","refs":[["Deut",7,4,7,4],["Deut",31,16,31,16],["Deut",31,17,31,17],["2Chr",19,2,19,2],["Ezra",9,13,9,13],["Ezra",9,14,9,14],["Ps",106,29,106,29],["Ps",106,40,106,40],["Isa",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Provoke God to leave mean to reap the fruits of them — Jos 23:12,13; Jdj 2:1-3.","refs":[["Josh",23,12,23,12],["Josh",23,13,23,13],["Judg",2,1,2,3]]},{"text":"Are ensnaring — Ex 23:33; Nu 25:18; De 12:30; 13:6; Ps 106:36.","refs":[["Exod",23,33,23,33],["Num",25,18,25,18],["Deut",12,30,12,30],["Deut",13,6,13,6],["Ps",106,36,106,36]]},{"text":"Are enslaved — 2Pe 2:18,19.","refs":[["2Pet",2,18,2,18],["2Pet",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Are defiling — Ezr 9:1,2.","refs":[["Ezra",9,1,9,1],["Ezra",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"Are degrading — Isa 1:23.","refs":[["Isa",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"Are ruinous to spiritual interest — Pr 29:24; Heb 12:14,15; 2Pe 3:17.","refs":[["Prov",29,24,29,24],["Heb",12,14,12,14],["Heb",12,15,12,15],["2Pet",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Are ruinous to moral character — 1Co 15:33.","refs":[["1Cor",15,33,15,33]]},{"text":"Are a proof of folly — Pr 12:11.","refs":[["Prov",12,11,12,11]]},{"text":"Children who enter into, bring shame upon their parents — Pr 28:7.","refs":[["Prov",28,7,28,7]]},{"text":"Evil consequences of — Pr 28:19; Jer 51:7.","refs":[["Prov",28,19,28,19],["Jer",51,7,51,7]]},{"text":"The wicked are prone to — Ps 50:18; Jer 2:25.","refs":[["Ps",50,18,50,18],["Jer",2,25,2,25]]},{"text":"The wicked tempt saints to — Ne 6:2-4.","refs":[["Neh",6,2,6,4]]},{"text":"Sin of, to be confessed, deeply repented of, and forsaken — Ezr 10:1-44.","refs":[["Ezra",10,1,10,44]]},{"text":"Involve saints in their guiltiness — 2Jo 1:9-11; Re 18:4.","refs":[["2John",1,9,1,11],["Rev",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Involve saints in their punishment — Nu 16:26; Jer 51:6; Re 18:4.","refs":[["Num",16,26,16,26],["Jer",51,6,51,6],["Rev",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Unbecoming in those called saints — 2Ch 19:2; 2Co 6:14-16; Php 2:15.","refs":[["2Chr",19,2,19,2],["2Cor",6,14,6,16],["Phil",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Exhortations to shun all inducements to — Pr 1:10-15; 4:14,15; 2Pe 3:17.","refs":[["Prov",1,10,1,15],["Prov",4,14,4,14],["Prov",4,15,4,15],["2Pet",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Exhortations to hate and avoid — Pr 14:7; Ro 16:17; 1Co 5:9-11; Eph 5:6,7; 1Ti 6:5; 2Ti 3:5.","refs":[["Prov",14,7,14,7],["Rom",16,17,16,17],["1Cor",5,9,5,11],["Eph",5,6,5,6],["Eph",5,7,5,7],["1Tim",6,5,6,5],["2Tim",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"A call to come out from — Nu 16:26; Ezr 10:11; Jer 51:6,45; 2Co 6:17; 2Th 3:6; Re 18:4.","refs":[["Num",16,26,16,26],["Ezra",10,11,10,11],["Jer",51,6,51,6],["Jer",51,45,51,45],["2Cor",6,17,6,17],["2Thess",3,6,3,6],["Rev",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Means of preservation from — Pr 2:10-20; 19:27.","refs":[["Prov",2,10,2,20],["Prov",19,27,19,27]]},{"text":"Blessedness of avoiding — Ps 1:1.","refs":[["Ps",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"Blessedness of forsaking — Ezr 9:12; Pr 9:6; 2Co 6:17,18.","refs":[["Ezra",9,12,9,12],["Prov",9,6,9,6],["2Cor",6,17,6,17],["2Cor",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Saints grieve to meet with, in their intercourse with the world — Ps 57:4; 120:5,6; 2Pe 2:7,8.","refs":[["Ps",57,4,57,4],["Ps",120,5,120,5],["Ps",120,6,120,6],["2Pet",2,7,2,7],["2Pet",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Saints grieve to witness in their brethren — Ge 26:35; Ezr 9:3; 10:6.","refs":[["Gen",26,35,26,35],["Ezra",9,3,9,3],["Ezra",10,6,10,6]]},{"text":"Saints hate and avoid — Ps 26:4,5; 31:6; 101:7; Re 2:2.","refs":[["Ps",26,4,26,4],["Ps",26,5,26,5],["Ps",31,6,31,6],["Ps",101,7,101,7],["Rev",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Saints deprecate — Ge 49:6; Ps 6:8; 15:4; 101:4,7; 119:115; 139:19.","refs":[["Gen",49,6,49,6],["Ps",6,8,6,8],["Ps",15,4,15,4],["Ps",101,4,101,4],["Ps",101,7,101,7],["Ps",119,115,119,115],["Ps",139,19,139,19]]},{"text":"Saints are separate from — Ex 33:16; Ezr 6:21.","refs":[["Exod",33,16,33,16],["Ezra",6,21,6,21]]},{"text":"Saints should be circumspect when unintentionally thrown into — Mt 10:16; Col 4:5; 1Pe 2:12.","refs":[["Matt",10,16,10,16],["Col",4,5,4,5],["1Pet",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Pious parents prohibit, to their children — Ge 28:1.","refs":[["Gen",28,1,28,1]]},{"text":"Persons in authority should denounce — Ezr 10:9-11; Ne 13:23-27.","refs":[["Ezra",10,9,10,11],["Neh",13,23,13,27]]},{"text":"Punishment of — Nu 33:56; De 7:4; Jos 23:13; Jdj 2:3; 3:5-8; Ezr 9:7,14; Ps 106:41,42; Re 2:16,22,23.","refs":[["Num",33,56,33,56],["Deut",7,4,7,4],["Josh",23,13,23,13],["Judg",2,3,2,3],["Judg",3,5,3,8],["Ezra",9,7,9,7],["Ezra",9,14,9,14],["Ps",106,41,106,41],["Ps",106,42,106,42],["Rev",2,16,2,16],["Rev",2,22,2,22],["Rev",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Solomon. — 1Ki 11:1-8.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,1,11,8]]},{"text":"Rehoboam. — 1Ki 12:8,9.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,8,12,8],["1Kgs",12,9,12,9]]},{"text":"Jehoshaphat. — 2Ch 18:3; 19:2; 20:35-37.","refs":[["2Chr",18,3,18,3],["2Chr",19,2,19,2],["2Chr",20,35,20,37]]},{"text":"Jehoram. — 2Ch 21:6.","refs":[["2Chr",21,6,21,6]]},{"text":"Ahaziah. — 2Ch 22:3-5.","refs":[["2Chr",22,3,22,5]]},{"text":"Israelites. — Ezr 9:1,2.","refs":[["Ezra",